35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The car came back with the fuel light on twice. That is unacceptable.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,The diary shows Saturday is three times busier than Tuesday. That explains the chaos.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The fixed costs are 280,000 yen. The mechanic says short runs hurt the car.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,Other groups failed because they had to ask favours every time. We are doing that.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Two people bought half the fuel. The recording trial took an hour a week.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, if two people drive half, why do I pay the same?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, because the fixed costs are high. But the time cost is real too.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, an hour a week is a lot. We need a system that is low effort.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, the heavy weeks are the problem. We need to avoid those clashes.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, I agree. But we need to know who drives to split the fuel fairly.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I want a system where I don't have to check the fuel gauge.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,I want a system where I don't have to calculate who owes what.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,I want a system that is fair but doesn't require constant checking.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I want a system that stops the awkwardness.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I want a system that uses the real data we have.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
