60,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option A gives me fixed days. I can plan my week without asking.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,May,,Option C divides costs by distance. That feels fairer than a flat share.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option B puts the burden on one person. That might be too much for one.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Option A avoids the favour-asking. That is what other groups said soured them.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Kenji,,Option C uses the recording we did. It is data-driven.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, yes, A stops the asking. But what if I don't use my day?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, you still pay the share. But you have the right to use it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, C requires recording every trip. That is the hour a week we found.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, that is a lot of work. A is simpler.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, true. But C is more accurate for fuel.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I prefer A. It gives me certainty.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,May,,I prefer C. It is fairer for those who drive more.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Servas,,I lean towards A. Simplicity is key for long-term peace.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I vote A. It prevents the conflict we saw in other groups.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I vote C. It uses the real data. But A is easier.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
